       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also have fixed several bugs reported by the communities and will continue to improve the overall experience for everyone.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The update details are as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Replace the current Chinese font that has been giving some players issues with loading",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Language fixes/update",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an infinite pumpkin charm glitch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor fixes with collision and pathing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Save Volume BGM Bug",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resized some Gallery Images",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed softlock at the beginning of Chapter 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
